{
    "title": "Formula 1\u00ae",
    "description": "Experience Formula 1 like never before with our official app! Your one-stop hub keeps you updated with the latest F1 news, thrilling highlights, race results, action-packed videos, real-time results and detailed schedules.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc1 Stay ahead of the curve with:\r\n\u2022\tThe latest F1 news and expert technical analysis\r\n\u2022\tRace weekend schedules and real-time results\r\n\u2022\tManage your F1 Fantasy team \r\n\u2022\tFree Leaderboard with live timings\r\n\u2022\tDriver and conductor standings \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea5For F1 TV Access subscribers, unlock a world of exclusive content including:\r\n\u2022\tLive telemetry data and session insights, including comprehensive tyre Information, lap times, speed and DRS.\r\n\u2022\tReal-time interactive Driver Tracker Maps\r\n\u2022\tLive English audio commentary\r\n\u2022\tListen to the drama unfold with the best of Team Radio\r\n\r\nDownload now for your ultimate companion into the world of Formula 1.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f How to subscribe to F1 TV\r\nF1 TV puts you in the driving seat \u2013 with race highlights, live timing and live streaming (available only in certain countries). You can subscribe to F1\u00ae TV with an annual or monthly subscription. \r\n\r\nSubscriptions renew automatically, unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours beforehand. You can turn off auto-renew at any time through your Play Store account.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/terms-of-use\r\nSubscription terms and conditions: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/subscription-terms\r\nPrivacy policy: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience Formula 1 like never before with our official app! Your one-stop hub keeps you updated with the latest F1 news, thrilling highlights, race results, action-packed videos, real-time results and detailed schedules.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc1 Stay ahead of the curve with:<br>\u2022\tThe latest F1 news and expert technical analysis<br>\u2022\tRace weekend schedules and real-time results<br>\u2022\tManage your F1 Fantasy team <br>\u2022\tFree Leaderboard with live timings<br>\u2022\tDriver and conductor standings <br><br>\ud83d\udea5For F1 TV Access subscribers, unlock a world of exclusive content including:<br>\u2022\tLive telemetry data and session insights, including comprehensive tyre Information, lap times, speed and DRS.<br>\u2022\tReal-time interactive Driver Tracker Maps<br>\u2022\tLive English audio commentary<br>\u2022\tListen to the drama unfold with the best of Team Radio<br><br>Download now for your ultimate companion into the world of Formula 1.<br><br>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f How to subscribe to F1 TV<br>F1 TV puts you in the driving seat \u2013 with race highlights, live timing and live streaming (available only in certain countries). You can subscribe to F1\u00ae TV with an annual or monthly subscription. <br><br>Subscriptions renew automatically, unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours beforehand. You can turn off auto-renew at any time through your Play Store account.<br><br>Terms of use: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/terms-of-use<br>Subscription terms and conditions: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/subscription-terms<br>Privacy policy: https://account.formula1.com/#/en/privacy-policy",
